@startuml
title CTS trade instruction processing

start

:Analyze incoming instruction;
:Classify instruction into kind;
if (Select instruction type) then (buy instruction)
:Process buy instruction;
:Match instructions by stock id and prescripts;
if (Check whether matching succeeds) then (matching succeeds)
:Make trade by matching;
:Modify matched instruction information;
:Save successful trade information;
:Provide interface to other modules;
:Send produced message to network message promulgating subsystem;
else (no matched stock)
endif
else (sell instruction)
:Process sell instruction;
endif
else (cancel instruction)
:Process cancel instruction;
:Cancel correlative instruction;
else (query instruction)
:Process query instruction;
:Implement query;
:Structuralize queried data;
:Send queried data to release system;

stop

@enduml